<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>%%DOCID%% - %%TITLE%%</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem; color: #333; background: #f8f9fa; }
  .container { background: #fff; padding: 3rem; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
  h1, h2, h3 { color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  h1 { border-bottom-width: 2px; }
  .meta { color: #667; font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: -0.5rem; }
  .mermaid { background: #fafafa; padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #eaeaea; border-radius: 6px; margin: 1.5rem 0; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .caption { color: #667; font-size: 0.85em; text-align: center; margin: -1rem 0 1.5rem; }
  .ticket { background: #fdfbf7; border-left: 4px solid #2ecc71; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; }
  .ticket.skeleton { border-left-color: #f39c12; background: #fffdf6; }
  .ticket h4 { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.05em; color: #2c3e50; }
  .ticket h4 a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dotted #aaa; }
  .wo-id { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 0.8em; color: #7f8c8d; font-weight: normal; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.72em; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 10px; vertical-align: middle; font-weight: 600; }
  .badge.draft { background: #ecf0f1; color: #7f8c8d; }
  .badge.ready { background: #d5f5e3; color: #1e8449; }
  .badge.in-progress { background: #d6eaf8; color: #1f618d; }
  .badge.in-review { background: #fdebd0; color: #b9770e; }
  .badge.done { background: #2ecc71; color: #fff; }
  .badge.stale { background: #fadbd8; color: #a93226; }
  .ac, .oq { margin: 0.6rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; font-size: 0.94em; }
  .ac li, .oq li { padding-left: 1.5rem; text-indent: -1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
  .oq li { color: #b9770e; }
  .dep { font-size: 0.85em; color: #667; margin-top: 0.6rem; }
  .code, code { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; background: #eee; padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 0.88em; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 1.5rem 0; font-size: 0.92em; }
  th, td { text-align: left; padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
  th { background: #f4f6f7; color: #2c3e50; }
  .note { background: #e8f4f8; border-left: 4px solid #3498db; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
  footer { margin-top: 2.5rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #95a5a6; font-size: 0.82em; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<h1>%%TITLE%%</h1>
<p class="meta"><strong>Document ID:</strong> %%DOCID%% &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Work order:</strong> <a href="%%EPIC_HREF%%"><code>%%EPIC_ID%%</code></a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Status:</strong> <span class="badge %%EPIC_STATUS%%">%%EPIC_STATUS%%</span></p>

%%BODY%%

<footer>
Generated by <code>cartograph.sh</code>. Ticket state read from <code>work-orders/</code> at render time - do not edit this file by hand.<br>
Regenerate: <code>%%REGEN%%</code>
</footer>
</div>
<script type="module">
  import mermaid from 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mermaid@10/dist/mermaid.esm.min.mjs';
  mermaid.initialize({ startOnLoad: true, theme: 'default' });
</script>
</body>
</html>
